<title>USA: Hovnanian names Ara Hovnanian CEO.</title>
<headline>Hovnanian names Ara Hovnanian CEO.</headline>
<dateline>RED BANK, N.J. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hovnanian Enterprises Inc on Wednesday said its president, Ara Hovnanian, will add the title of chief executive.</p>
<p>Hovnanian's father, Kevork Hovnanian, will relinquish the chief executive's title and remain as chairman, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Hovnanian makes houses, townhouses and condominiums in planned residential communities in seven U.S. states and in Poland.</p>
</text>
